+ * 运行：
+ *   MUSE_BRIDGE_ENABLED=1 npx tsx scripts/muse-bridge/gate0-fixture.ts --org <orgId> --email <青砚邮箱>
+ *   npx tsx scripts/muse-bridge/gate0-fixture.ts --org <orgId> --cleanup      # 删除 [MUSE-QA] 数据
+ *
